==== hyperbricks yaml {!{image}} ====
image:
  - type: image
  - class: aclass bclass cclass
  - src: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg
  - title: Some Cute Cat!
  - width: "100"
==== explainer ====
CSS class for styling the image
